sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Pipeline
  participant C as Consumers
  participant N as New Version
  participant O as Old Version
  participant S as Stateful Store
  P->>C: Deploy consumer-compatible change
  P->>N: Deploy new version
  N->>S: Additive schema / dual read-write
  P->>N: Start canary traffic
  alt SLO and integrity pass
    P->>N: Increase traffic
    P->>O: Drain and retire after window
  else Failure
    P->>N: Stop traffic
    P->>O: Restore prior route
    P->>S: Roll forward or compensate state
  end

